  "title": "Mini Sweet Potato Pies",
  "description": "Cute, bite-sized, mini sweet potato pies. Always a winner for the holidays and easy enough to make! Great for holiday dinner parties or sweet appetizers!",
  "authors": [
    "NCANNIS"
  ],
